5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the winter road closures north of the river and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers to assess our vulnerability to external disruptions.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops! I want to see how people are actually getting to us.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I shall review the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year. I want to understand the long-term stability of our funding.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll dive into the two programmes begun six years ago and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. Let's see what we've actually tried before and how people use us after hours!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I will look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and also the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. I want to see who is available to help.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
